					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Math problem. If he's recently moved from the place with the roomies from hell, how are the only places left his parents' and his current place? Isn't that apt still there or is he somehow waiting for it to burn after it's burnt?</p> <p>I really want to like this, but that little thing bugs me every time I read it! Stupid pedantry ruining a good tale!</p> 
				 	]]>
